{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic strategy tower defense game centered around &quot;Protecting Seagrass.&quot; Players must deploy various seagrass and jellyfish in the ocean to defend against invading sharks. The game features dozens of unique levels, unlocking diverse gameplay mechanics and techniques. In terms of gameplay, players first place seagrass, which generates nutrients. Jellyfish, by absorbing these nutrients, can unlock bubble attacks. Through a series of defensive actions\u2014production, defense, and shooting\u2014players must adapt tactics flexibly to achieve the goal of protecting the seagrass. Come and give it a try now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147780?t=1763103162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4147780?t=1763103162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147780/2504aabe4705c321d6417ef8a81c848d91fef6ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763103162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147780/2504aabe4705c321d6417ef8a81c848d91fef6ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763103162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic strategy tower defense game centered around &quot;Protecting Seagrass.&quot; Players must deploy various seagrass and jellyfish in the ocean to defend against invading sharks. The game features dozens of unique levels, unlocking diverse gameplay mechanics and techniques. In terms of gameplay, players first place seagrass, which generates nutrients. Jellyfish, by absorbing these nutrients, can unlock bubble attacks. Through a series of defensive actions\u2014production, defense, and shooting\u2014players must adapt tactics fle